r FULL BIO FOR MERCEDES LONG Email [email protected] Heather Major Senior Payroll Specialist FULL BIO FOR HEATHER MAJOR Email [email protected] Nicole McMenamin Director, Human Resources Systems and Payroll FULL BIO FOR NICOLE MCMENAMIN Email [email protected] Larisa Shambaugh Vice President of Human Resources and Employee Experience FULL BIO FOR LARISA SHAMBAUGH Rebecca Thompson HR System Specialist FULL BIO FOR REBECCA THOMPSON Email [email protected] Transparency Coverage Rule Machine-Readable Files Provision Learn More About Transparency Coverage Rule (TCR) Machine-Readable Files (MRFs) Provision The Transparency in Coverage Rule (TCR) requires health plans and plan sponsors to make in-network and out-of-network machine-readable files (MRFs) available to the public. Links for each plan offered by Arcadia University can be found below: KHPE MRF URL QCC MRF URL AHPA MRF URL Annual Fire Safety Report View Arcadia's Annual Fire Safety Report Arcadia University’s Non-Discrimination Statement Arcadia University does not discriminate or permit discrimination as outlined in our Non-Discrimination Statement . Our Lived Values include Equity and Respect. More information may be found here . Contact Us Human Resources 777 Limekiln Pike 215-572-2173 [email protected] Payroll Questions [email protected] Benefits Questions [email protected] Talent Acquisition Questions [email protected] Apply Visit Give Careers PortalGuard Apply Visit Give Careers PortalGuard 450 S. Easton Road Glenside, PA 19038 1-877-ARCADIA (1-877-272-2342) Campus Map & Tour EMERGENCY NEWS Student Resources Events & Calendar Offices & Facilities Athletics Canvas Self Service (staff login required) IT Help Desk INFO FOR Alumni Students Faculty & Staff Login Families Title IX All contents ©2026 Arcadia University. All rights reserved. Accessibility Non-Discrimination Notice Privacy Policy Close Search Form MENU A Prospective Student A Parent/Family Member A Current Student An Alumnus / Alumna A Faculty / Sta